# Rust build artifacts
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo local config overrides (the committed .cargo/config.toml stays)
.cargo/registry/
.cargo/git/

# cudabom local data / caches
#   The advisory index and fingerprint DB are built into the XDG data dir at
#   runtime, but a local override may land here during development.
/.cudabom/
/data/

# Ephemeral test fixtures.
#   fixtures/src/ (CUDA C++ sources) IS committed. Compiled fixtures are not:
#   they are built by an optional CI job in an official NVIDIA CUDA container
#   and are treated as throwaway artifacts. NVIDIA binaries must never be
#   committed (see docs/fingerprints/README.md).
/fixtures/build/
/fixtures/out/

# Real-world evaluation corpus and downloaded NVIDIA redistributables (used to
# derive fingerprints). NEVER committed: respecting NVIDIA license terms and
# keeping the repo free of third-party binaries. Only *derived* fingerprint
# data (hashes, symbol sets, version patterns) under fingerprints/ is committed.
/corpus/
/.fingerprint-cache/
/fingerprints/downloads/

# Fuzzing artifacts
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/

# Release/data-bundle build outputs (produced by `cargo xtask bundle` and the
# release workflow). These are published as release assets, never committed.
/dist/
*.tar.gz
*.tar.gz.sha256

# Snap build outputs (snapcraft writes these into the project dir).
*.snap
/parts/
/prime/
/stage/

# Coverage artifacts (cargo-llvm-cov / grcov).
/coverage/
*.profraw
*.profdata

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Generated documentation site.
#   .hugo/content/ is regenerated from docs/*.md + data by build_docs.py, and
#   .hugo/public/ is Hugo's build output. The theme is a git submodule and the
#   config (.hugo/hugo.toml) and generator are committed; the generated trees
#   are not.
/.hugo/content/
/.hugo/public/
/.hugo/resources/
/.hugo/.hugo_build.lock

# Snap Store publishing credentials, minted locally via `snapcraft export-login`
# and uploaded to the GitHub `snapcraft` environment. Never commit the token.
/.snapcreds/
*snapcraft-creds*.txt
